1
00:00:00,604 --> 00:00:03,024
(Sheldon:)Would you like some aloe vera?

2
00:00:03,231 --> 00:00:05,111
(Sheldon:)You just got burned.

3
00:00:07,736 --> 00:00:10,026
All right, my turn. Ahem.

4
00:00:10,238 --> 00:00:13,528
"Howard, Bernadette:"

5
00:00:17,537 --> 00:00:20,627
Sheldon, I told you, no Klingon.

6
00:00:24,586 --> 00:00:27,626
(Sheldon:)Fine, I'll do it in English,
but it loses something.

7
00:00:29,591 --> 00:00:33,381
"The need to find another human being
to share one's life with...

8
00:00:33,595 --> 00:00:35,305
(Sheldon:)...has always puzzled me.

9
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:40,140
(Sheldon:)Maybe because I'm so interesting
all by myseIf.

10
00:00:41,853 --> 00:00:45,903
(Sheldon:)With that being said, may you find
as much happiness with each other...

11
00:00:46,108 --> 00:00:48,818
...as I find on my own."

12
00:00:49,319 --> 00:00:53,019
(Sheldon:)The Klingon would have made you cry.

